<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Task Status Changed</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>Task Status Updated</h2>
  <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
  <p>The status of task <strong>{{taskTitle}}</strong> has changed.</p>
  <p>From: {{oldStatus}}</p>
  <p>To: {{newStatus}}</p>
  <p>Please log in to the task management system to view more details.</p>
</body>
</html>